the final population to the nearest whole fish. Do not round intermediate values." :question/worked-solution "The solution of $P'(t)=0.09P(t)$ satisfies\n\n$$P(t)=P(18)e^{0.09(t-18)}=8\\,000e^{0.09(t-18)}.$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$P(23)=8\\,000e^{0.45}\\approx12\\,546.49748392135.$$\n\nRounding only this final value to the nearest whole number gives approximately $12\\,546$ fish." :question/answer-fields ["q-339239/mathematical-correction-v1/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
